    "text": "December 2020. A year ago this was a franchise burger unit that was losing money every week; you de-branded it, kept the grill and the fryers, and scraped through the spring on takeout. Last month you signed with Virtual Dining Concepts: from tonight your kitchen also cooks MrBeast Burger and Mariah's Cookies for the delivery apps. VDC handles the brand and the marketing and takes a cut of every order; the apps take theirs. The launch is going to be enormous. Nobody knows how long it lasts."
